(https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-HunyuanImage3), Copyright (C) 2026 PedroMarinhoDev, GPL-3.0.
Modifications: rewritten for WanGP's model-plugin API, mmgp offloading and WanGP's W4A8 kernels; ComfyUI
operations, attention, rope and VAE/vision loaders replaced with plain PyTorch; prompt rewriting and
Spectrum removed; tiled VAE encode/decode added.

