The SigLIP2 vision tower code (models/hy3_vision.py) follows the Hugging Face transformers implementation
(Apache-2.0). The W4A8 storage format is comfy_kitchen's AsymW4A8Int8Layout (Apache-2.0, Comfy Org).

The HunyuanImage-3.0 model weights are not part of this plugin; they are downloaded from Hugging Face and
